luau
------------------------------------------
Fast, small, safe, gradually typed embeddable scripting language derived from Lua

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.7.0-0.618.g8f145421c964
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libisocline1-1.1.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libisocline-devel-1.1.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/luau-lang/luau

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/luau-lang/luau/archive/refs/tags/0.741.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack luau-0.741-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./luau-0.741-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/luau-0.741-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/luau-0.741-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(luau)
  /usr/bin/luau-analyze.exe
  /usr/bin/luau-ast.exe
  /usr/bin/luau-bytecode.exe
  /usr/bin/luau-compile.exe
  /usr/bin/luau-reduce.exe
  /usr/bin/luau.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/luau.README
  /usr/share/doc/luau/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/luau/README.md

------------------

